  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s25/03c873fc> ;
  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s21/191c198b> ;
  triage:notes "Initial pass baseline correlation: remote-path business logic inline in dispatch_send (lines 69-100) with helper build_remote_deferred_outcome (lines 124-165) remains unconsolidated vs. local path (line 62) which delegates to execute_outbound_send_with_runtime_and_post_send_emitter. All branches AG18-25 contain this issue; fix is currently in progress on feature/pAG-s21-collapse-dispatch-routing via arch-ctm's AG21-FIX-1 task. S22-25 remain pinned at baseline 03c873fc (not yet branched/started) and will inherit fix via merge-forward after AG21 lands. Verify fix by confirming (1) shared core function consolidates both local and remote paths, (2) no inline outcome-disposition logic remains in dispatch_send, (3) symbol resolves in crates/ and matches sprint-AG21.md acceptance criteria, (4) req-qa/arch-qa re-confirm consolidation is complete. Do not mark closed until all consolidated logic is wired through all call sites." .

